{"4182600": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dark Engines", "steam_appid": 4182600, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark Engines</strong> is a white-knuckle medieval car combat game inspired by the golden era of vehicular combat.  Blast your way through the character-driven campaign and brutal online multiplayer. Carve your path across a growing campaign map, unlock new juggernauts, powers, and cosmetics, and fight toward each rider’s final showdown and epic conclusion.    <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182600/extras/7996808c8dc624439bf038161ef9d6cc.poster.avif?t=1780415258\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182600/extras/7996808c8dc624439bf038161ef9d6cc.webm?t=1780415258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182600/extras/7996808c8dc624439bf038161ef9d6cc.mp4?t=1780415258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose Your Juggernaut</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every juggernaut rider has their own stats, handling, passive ability, and special move. Find the vehicle that fits your style and master its strengths on the battlefield. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182600/extras/aeb4db83eedf941aa912bedf49a945d6.poster.avif?t=1780415258\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182600/extras/aeb4db83eedf941aa912bedf49a945d6.webm?t=1780415258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182600/extras/aeb4db83eedf941aa912bedf49a945d6.mp4?t=1780415258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Weapons, Destruction, and Arena Combat</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield purposeful weapons and imbue them with fire, ice, or lightning. Fight across handcrafted arenas filled with weapon drops, tactical objectives, AI enemies, bosses, and destructible sections that can change the flow of battle.   </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182600/extras/1ffd1b49834cf299e9c837e318f8e9a4.poster.avif?t=1780415258\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182600/extras/1ffd1b49834cf299e9c837e318f8e9a4.webm?t=1780415258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182600/extras/1ffd1b49834cf299e9c837e318f8e9a4.mp4?t=1780415258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182600/extras/d55f618e0e3c1cd44d00ad7a088a8cdb.poster.avif?t=1780415258\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182600/extras/d55f618e0e3c1cd44d00ad7a088a8cdb.webm?t=1780415258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182600/extras/d55f618e0e3c1cd44d00ad7a088a8cdb.mp4?t=1780415258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Modes Built for Chaos</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on classic modes like Capture the Flag, King of the Hill, and Last Man Standing, alongside original modes like <strong>Slay the Dragon</strong> and <strong>Fire and Ice</strong>. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Fire and Ice</strong>, teams fight to control a hill and claim the power of fire, while the remaining teams wield ice. The fire team can push into enemy bases and destroy their barrels while the others scramble to defend. When the hill changes, the battle for elemental control begins again. Be the last team that still has their barrels! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182600/extras/e31f6f067d50e1d4658b08a4054e5c7a.poster.avif?t=1780415258\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182600/extras/e31f6f067d50e1d4658b08a4054e5c7a.webm?t=1780415258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182600/extras/e31f6f067d50e1d4658b08a4054e5c7a.mp4?t=1780415258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Single-Player Campaign</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push through a branching web of handcrafted maps and modes as each juggernaut rider battles through their own path. Uncover new routes, unlock additional characters deeper in the campaign, and defeat powerful bosses to earn each character’s ending cutscene.    </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182600/extras/ea655a8d1ed55e8bfa780bf01570c88c.poster.avif?t=1780415258\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182600/extras/ea655a8d1ed55e8bfa780bf01570c88c.webm?t=1780415258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182600/extras/ea655a8d1ed55e8bfa780bf01570c88c.mp4?t=1780415258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182600/extras/e0fa5508a9fb1b216b067885703a2f00.poster.avif?t=1780415258\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182600/extras/e0fa5508a9fb1b216b067885703a2f00.webm?t=1780415258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182600/extras/e0fa5508a9fb1b216b067885703a2f00.mp4?t=1780415258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>From impactful driving and destruction to deep sound design and gritty atmosphere, Dark Engines is built to deliver the satisfying car combat your heart yearns for.</strong> <br> </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182600/extras/1fb149c9d7f2a2ef5f48ea0ddd82ba84.poster.avif?t=1780415258\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182600/extras/1fb149c9d7f2a2ef5f48ea0ddd82ba84.webm?t=1780415258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182600/extras/1fb149c9d7f2a2ef5f48ea0ddd82ba84.mp4?t=1780415258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark Engines</strong> is a white-knuckle medieval car combat game insp